__`ContentFieldRenderer` Logic:__

- `null/undefined` → Return `null` (hide section)
- `string` → `<MarkdownRenderer />`
- `string[]` → `<BulletListRenderer />`
- `object` with `type: 'steps'` → Stepped treatment display
- `object` (generic) → `<KeyValueRenderer />`

